.TH TDXVIEW 1 "2026-09-04" "tdx 0.19" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tdxview \- CGA/MDA user-screen viewer for tdx
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tdxview
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tdxview
attaches to tdx's UNIX socket and shows the guest framebuffer
(CGA B800 or MDA B000).
It listens on
.I /tmp/tdxview.sock
so agents can screenshot and type without Xmux.
.P
No arguments still starts (needs tdx on
.BR \-\-sock ).
.P
CGA graphics default to
.B old-CGA NTSC composite
(Reenigne/86Box). Mode 4 (PCBIOS M7 3D8=2Ah, burst on) is 320×200
scaled ×2. Use
.B \-\-no\-composite
for RGBI (cyan/magenta on palette 1).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-sock " PATH"
tdx socket (default
.IR /tmp/tdx.sock ).
.TP
.BI \-\-listen " PATH"
Agent socket (default
.IR /tmp/tdxview.sock ).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-listen
Do not listen for agents.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-composite
CGA gfx as RGBI. Default is old-CGA NTSC artifact color.
.TP
.BI \-\-scale " N"
Graphics scale (default 2, 640 by 400). Text is always 640 by 400.
.SH KEYS
Alt-X quits.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /tmp/tdx.sock
tdx control socket.
.TP
.I /tmp/tdxview.sock
Agent socket for this window.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Connect or SDL error.
.TP
.B 2
Bad command line.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.B tdxview --sock /tmp/tdx.sock --listen /tmp/tdxview.sock --scale 2
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tdx (1),
.BR tdxctl (1)
